[heading]Accessing file...[/heading][collapse=>Sawians (Experiments)]Sawians are a man-made species with combined DNA of human, fox, and rat, resulting in a canine-like species. Instead of red, their blood is yellow, made out of different chemicals compared to humans.[/collapse][collapse=>Grey Planet]The Grey Planet is a place with an easy space-travel route from Earth.[/collapse][center][heading][color=black]Cᴀsᴜᴀʟᴛɪᴇs: Uɴᴋɴᴏᴡɴ + 0[/color][/heading][/center][collapse=Recorded Casualties...]Nᴏ ᴅᴀᴛᴀ... Dɪsᴋ sᴘᴀᴄᴇ 100%[/collapse]
[indent][indent][indent][indent][indent][indent][right][collapse=Fortunate Souls][color=gray][i]If you ever see me online on any profile, don't hesitate to ask if I can play as your preferred character.[/i][/color][heading][color=orange]E-260426 "Alec"[/color] [icon]E-260426[/icon][/heading]A cheerful expie, who, despite the circumstances, manages to pull through everyday struggles with a smile on his face.[heading][color=blue]E-112358 "Soren"[/color] [icon]E-112358[/icon][/heading]Where's a medic when you need one? This highly skilled surgeon might not be the most talkative, but he'll get you out of trouble.[heading][color=blue]E-24680 "Evens"[/color] & [color=orange]E-13579 "Oddsy"[/color] [icon]Even At Odds[/icon][/heading]Quite the intriguing couple of sawians; a milky with melanism paired with an experiment with albinism.[/collapse][/right][/indent][/indent][/indent][/indent][/indent][/indent][hr][hr]
